00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.300
And while sci-fi has its
fair share of cool lasers

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.260
and sleek hairdos,

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:49.310
it's also uniquely positioned
to explore big ideas.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:51.650
